Unicode-Towctrans version 0.01
===================================

Unicode::Towctrans - Generate small casefolding tables

SYNOPSIS

    ./mkheader
    ./mkheader -v 15

DESCRIPTION

mkheader generates a towctrans.h header file, which is used by musl and safeclib
to generate small and efficient case folding tables, to build the libc towupper() and
towlower() functions and its secure variants towupper_s() and towlower_s().
It also will be used to generate the multi-byte foldings header file for towfc().

INSTALLATION

Perl 5.8.1 or later is required.

This module does not need to be installed. running mkheader is enough.
However for testing run this:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test

DEPENDENCIES

This module requires the CaseFolding.txt file from Unicode Character
Database.

